   "id": 520411,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "<figure class=\"unnumbered\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/c053610d36c6b11b.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<figcaption>(credit: modification of work by Samir S. Radwan, et al./<i>Scientific Reports</i>, under CC BY 4.0 license)</figcaption>\n</figure>",
   "stem_html": "<p>The image shows the results of a research that studied various bacteria for their ability to remove mercury, cadmium and lead from an environment over time.</p>\n<p>Make a claim about removal of mercury by these bacteria?</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1017049,
     "content_html": "All the bacteria shown here can remove mercury from the environment."
    },
    {
     "id": 1017050,
     "content_html": "The bacteria that remove the mercury complete the process in 3-4 days."
    },
    {
     "id": 1017051,
     "content_html": "The bacteria that remove the mercury complete the process in 7-8 days."
    },
    {
     "id": 1017052,
     "content_html": "Only a few bacteria shown here can remove the mercury from the environment."
    }
   ],
